fix(webview): generate model icons before typechecking

`model-icons-data.ts` is derived from `@lobehub/icons` at build time and is
gitignored, but `typecheck` ran `vue-tsc` without generating it first — so a
fresh clone (which is exactly what CI does) failed with TS2307 on
`./model-icons-data.ts`. Locally the file was already present from an earlier
build, which hid the problem.

Caught by the new CI pipeline on its first run.